  vendorName: Scrapper Sullivan
  offerText: That mountainous pile of rusted machinery in the corner is a complete
    hazard. I will write you a check right now to haul the entire eyesore away.
  acceptResultText: Sullivan's crew efficiently clears out the heavy scrap. You pocket
    the check and take a deep breath in your newly cleared room.
  rejectResultText: You refuse his offer. Ten minutes later, a sharp piece of the
    rusted metal catches your ankle, leaving a painful gash.
